      <subsection name="Description" id="JavadocNoErrorInThrowsTag_Description">
        <div>
          Checks that <code>Error</code> types are not documented in <code>@throws</code> or
          <code>@exception</code> Javadoc tags.
        </div>

        <p>
          Per the documentation comments style guide, errors should not be documented
          because they are unpredictable. This check reports <code>Error</code>,
          <code>java.lang.Error</code>, and documented throwable names whose simple name ends
          with <code>Error</code>.
        </p>
      </subsection>

